 "synopsis": "TSF Investments Ltd announced that its board of directors approved the sale of its entire holding of 7,55,682 equity shares, representing a 3.74 per cent stake, in TVS Holdings Ltd. The shares are to be sold to existing members of the Promoter and Promoter Group of TVS Holdings Ltd through a block deal window mechanism or another permitted regulatory framework. The transaction is not a related party transaction and is expected to be completed on or before November 2.",
